    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 25 ('Trail of Betrayal (the live dungeon: the trolls who drove the chugawugs out, alo'): scene bw_trail_of_betrayal, 6 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Sampson Idlefist last; every spot is the fork's."
