    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Card: Global.Text 5706, 91641, icon 680 (the fork battle's own ids)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: the scene bw_trail_of_betrayal needs one native load with this roster. The fork's scene layout, not a captured one; local kinds take ids 13050*100+n; knockouts, score, coins and the level gate are the fork fights' (fights/14xxx.json); job XP is the battles' 50."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) 1 later group(s) of the fork come as waves at their own spots: the first when the guards are down, each next one when the one before is down or 16 s after it (the captured Frostfang battle's gap)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done when the boss falls; the boss waits, dormant, for the waves. The results follow the exit door, which opens with the main goal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Built by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/trail_of_betrayal.json, its notes page and the fork battle; under the id (13050) quests name."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
