    },
    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'FR Place:Trail of Betrayal' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/FR_Place_Trail_of_Betrayal.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's. (R) The wiki's spelling read as the client's item: 'Pin Hole Archer Glove' as 'Pin Hole Archer Gloves'."}
